1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:02,334
(Leonard:)If that was a movie, I would go see it.

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:03,712
(Penny:)I know, right?

3
00:00:03,879 --> 00:00:05,589
(Penny:)Okay, let's see, what else?

4
00:00:07,049 --> 00:00:08,759
I guess that's about it.

5
00:00:09,343 --> 00:00:11,553
(Penny:)That's the story of Penny.

6
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:13,717
(Leonard:)Well, it sounds wonderful.

7
00:00:14,848 --> 00:00:16,268
(Penny:)It was.

8
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:19,933
(Penny:)Until I fell in love with a jerk.

9
00:00:23,065 --> 00:00:24,445
What is happening?

10
00:00:24,608 --> 00:00:26,608
[MOUTHS]
I don't know.

11
00:00:26,777 --> 00:00:29,027
(Penny:)Oh, God, you know,
four years I lived with him.

12
00:00:29,196 --> 00:00:32,366
(Penny:)Four years.
That's like as long as high school.

13
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:35,032
(Sheldon:)It took you four years
to get through high school?

14
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:40,753
(Penny:)I just... I can't believe I trusted him.

15
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:47,253
(Leonard:)Should I say something?
I feel I should say something.

16
00:00:47,422 --> 00:00:49,092
(Sheldon:)You? No, you'll only make it worse.

17
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:51,427
You wanna know the most pathetic part?

18
00:00:51,593 --> 00:00:55,133
(Penny:)Even though I hate his lying,
cheating guts...

19
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:57,765
(Penny:)...I still love him.

